From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] hdSt renderer-neutral GPU BasisCurves group API

Generated from the private OpenUSD extension tree. This patch is relative
to patches 0001 and 0002: it adds only the group candidate/ready-provider/
mailbox SDK and its HdSt build registration; it does not install a filter,
wire render-delegate callbacks, or publish groom scene data.

